  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Morocco Earthquake Relief and Recovery</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since 1987, Near East Foundation has partnered with many of the Moroccan communities hit hardest by the the recent earthquake. As aftershocks continue, families are sleeping in the streets, fearful of sheltering in their damaged homes.  Our staff in Morocco are mobilizing resources to assist the hardest hit communities and are asking for your support. Your donation will support impacted communities to meet critical basic needs, restore basic services, and begin to recover from the disaster.</narrative>
  </description>
